      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS KIT (1) is progressing well with another good run, placing by 0.8 lengths (25.48) in a Bottom Up - Restricted Win at Warrnambool. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Makes plenty of appeal. VAPORIZE (3) jumped well and was a winner (30.28) two back from a tricky draw then last start drew a squeeze box again but got further back and finished 5th at The Meadows (30.91). Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Likely to be about the money. SAFFRON MONSOON (2) is a consistent type who is new here. Comes here a winner after using the inside draw to advantage last time, scoring by a long neck at Sandown over 595m (35.04). Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure.",
